WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.6 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Pay, careers and recognition

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Set your pay principles before the first salary; fixing unfair gaps later is much harder.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Decide how salaries, increases and founder pay are set.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Sketch simple pay bands, even for one or two roles.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Recognise people well when you cannot yet pay much.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write your pay principles and a simple band structure.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
